WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.312
Here's the whole picture.

2
00:00:01.312 --> 00:00:04.424
The full version, with
notes, is in the backup.

3
00:00:04.424 --> 00:00:09.647
For Windows devices joined to Entra,
Autopilot or Intune names the device,

4
00:00:09.647 --> 00:00:13.413
and the DHCP server registers
it, with signed updates.

5
00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:18.442
Hybrid-joined Windows, during the
transition, keeps working as it does today,

6
00:00:18.442 --> 00:00:21.875
through AD; it moves to the
first row when it's rebuilt.

7
00:00:21.875 --> 00:00:24.788
Macs are renamed in
Intune after enrollment.

8
00:00:24.788 --> 00:00:28.941
The DHCP server should register
them, but that's an inference:

9
00:00:28.941 --> 00:00:32.513
I couldn't verify how macOS
behaves with dynamic DNS.

10
00:00:32.513 --> 00:00:37.533
Linux gets its name from cloud-init or a
static hostname, and DHCP registers it,

11
00:00:37.533 --> 00:00:41.376
unless it's in an identity domain
that signs its own updates.

12
00:00:41.376 --> 00:00:45.250
On-premises servers with fixed
addresses get static records.

13
00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:50.450
Azure VMs are named at create time and
autoregistered, within the limits we saw.

14
00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:52.565
AWS instances get AWS names,

15
00:00:52.565 --> 00:00:57.713
and anything custom needs your
own pipeline or IPAM integration.

16
00:00:57.713 --> 00:01:02.057
And printers and other devices that
can't be managed get their names from

17
00:01:02.057 --> 00:01:06.474
a reservation or the device itself,
with DHCP registering on their behalf.

18
00:01:06.474 --> 00:01:17.448
Sources: Research brief, Per-platform
table, and the sources cited in each row:

19
00:01:17.448 --> 00:01:27.550
Autopilot and Rename [S1, S3–S5], Accounts
CSP [S6], macOS ADE and Apple MDM [S7,

20
00:01:27.550 --> 00:01:38.348
S9], systemd, cloud-init, NetworkManager,
FreeIPA [S10–S14], Arc and Azure [S15–S17,

21
00:01:38.348 --> 00:01:46.534
S19, S20], AWS [S21–S23], Dynamic
update and ADMX_DnsClient [S26,

22
00:01:46.534 --> 00:01:53.740
S27], aging [S30], NIOS [S41,
S42, S48]; Book 08 Ch04 and Ch10.
